  "task_id": "five_agent_solar_pipe_inspection",
  "instruction": "Inspect the laboratory solar-panel and pipe test rig with five coordinated robot controllers. The static Franka must prepare the inspection kit and place it in the shared handoff. The Franka mounted on Husky must load the kit, Husky must transport it, and the mounted Franka must install its thermal reference before inspection. B2 may move only while the Z1 thermal-camera arm is stowed. Z1 must scan both the solar panel and pipe rig from measured B2 viewpoints and localize the single seeded thermal anomaly without assuming its hidden physical location. Husky may move only while its Franka is stowed. After localization, Husky must position its Franka at the service dock, where the Franka must physically confirm and mark the reported anomaly, then operate the nearby mock isolation control. B2/Z1 must perform a verification scan. Every shared zone must be acquired and released explicitly, no robot may wait while holding a shared resource, all waits and acquisitions must be bounded, and both mobile platforms and all arms must finish home or stowed.",
